Attribution
-----------

Parts of the design of review-mcp are derived from PR-Agent
(https://github.com/The-PR-Agent/pr-agent), an open-source, AI-powered code
review agent, licensed under the MIT License. In particular:

- the pull-request diff compression strategy (file ranking, hunk context
  expansion, token-budget clipping, large-PR handling),
- the token budgeting approach,
- the per-tool prompt design and structured output schemas for review and
  question-answering tools.

review-mcp is an independent reimplementation in Go. No PR-Agent source code
is included in this repository; the logic, prompt design, and schemas were
studied and ported (see docs/research/pr-agent-porting-map.md for the pinned
upstream revision used during the study).

Many thanks to the PR-Agent authors, maintainers, and community.
